ent":null,"contents":[{"content":"你放心，我们聊的内容我都会守住，不会往外讲。不过如果遇到涉及你安全的情况，我会和你一起想办法。倒是你刚说“是不是自己太矫情”，这句话听着有点自责，你平时也常这样对自己吗？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1831,"promptTokens":1884,"completionTokens":78,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:57:04"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":9,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008575114328672796,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af66e70f4429d1fd72f6ad6","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794535024967,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:57:04","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66e70f4429d1fd72f6ad6","chatId":"b07d100c541948a08c7b004cd5ff4d21","sessionId":null,"userId":99792,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"说不上来……可能就是一团气吧。有时候又觉得，是不是我自己太矫情了。对了，我想问一下，我在这儿说的话，你不会跟别人讲吧？<第4轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":8,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008575114328672796,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af66e70f4429d1fd72f6ad7","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794535024964,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:57:04","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66e6cf4429d1fd72f6ac8","chatId":"b07d100c541948a08c7b004cd5ff4d21","sessionId":null,"userId":99792,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"心里堵得慌又讲不清楚，这种感觉确实挺难受的，好像有什么东西压着，却找不到出口。我们不用急着给它下定义。你先感受一下，这份堵，更像是闷在心里的一团气，还是像有什么话一直没说出口？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioCont